zXVk2O8lsQ7kNvwG6B7ER&_nc_oc=AdpdJorj02GmbVhp9-Uq77HIQAeXOVQs6IycLV44K-FEY9_vGoZWNItLdPubLmDI_74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE-yiKXgs3myGO1sgtf-bf0BK3Wsk5dWchI3JPat1kqXQ&oe=6A707E9D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "294735778406481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982510_294735781739814_4601886414751003638_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2LQ-_VrzD50Q7kNvwHQNUYU&_nc_oc=AdpqgZUt4VObFzEQiD3hTIe1ppFdQl5Ep3szP9-UU5mx6QCMdeER0OxIgX4tfiMU5-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHjYXZSVRh_YlGfTwtytgaGXx1P2CM5XGlRdpFVDBuA2Q&oe=6A70918E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OLC VR", "keywords": ["learning", "education", "360video", "development", "energy"], "long_description": "Real Learning in a Virtual World: Taking learning to the next level through the World Bank Group (WBG) - Open Learning Campus (OLC)  VR app. \n \nWBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challanges of global development. \n \nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generation interactive learnin